      "value": "@{62b61f8ec938a62475e4cd14|full_name}: Here an image for the reason the radial can't be open. When the radial is open, a timer start. But it can be stop by multiple factor. Go/Pose is one of them. Since the bool never become True when sitting in a chair, it force close it the moment you try to open it.\n\nWhen sitting in a chair, the float is set to 18% when you inter the substate. But since the parameter driver don't seen to apply that it stay at the 25% default.",
